## Managed by hyperlab-ansible (roles/host_audit). ADR 0040, host option A.
##
## Writes and attribute changes to HyperLab's trust points. Detection only:
## root can stop auditd and erase its log, so the records count once they
## have left the host. Only paths that existed when this file was written
## are listed: a watch on a missing path stops auditd loading later rules.
{% for watch in host_audit_present %}
-w {{ watch.path }} -p wa -k {{ watch.key }}
{% endfor %}
